        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko lilayika line lilyalamulilaga moto, lyakopocele kutyocela ku malo gakupelecela mbopesi. Jwagumisile ni maloŵe gamacili kwa jwele juŵakwete cikwakwa acitiji kuti, “Mkamulisye masengo cikwakwa cenuco, mtande kukata mipeleya kutyocela ku mgunda wa mipeleya ŵa cilambo capasi pakuti mipeleyajo jajiwile kalakala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papopo, lilayika lila lyagatandite masengo ni cikwakwa cakwe cila, ni ŵakatile mipeleya josope ja pacilambo capasi, ni kujiponya mwakuminyila mipeleya, yele yikugopolela lutumbilo lwa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mipeleya jila jaminyidwe m'malo mwakuminyila mipeleyajo kusa kwa msinda. Mwakuminyila mipeleyamo mwakopwece miasi nipo jaliji mkwendelecela mpela lusulo, ulewu wakwe makilomita 300, nipo kusokoka kwakwe kwaliji ciŵandika mamita gaŵili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.20"
            ]
          }
